## Brand & Visual Standards (JesusUnited.org)
- Canvas: Warm Linen Ivory (`#FAF7EE`)
- Typography: Plus Jakarta Sans (Headings: 700/800 tight tracking, Body: 400/500)
- Accents: Honey Gold (`#D4A359`, Hover: `#C49348`)
- Surfaces: Pure White (`#FFFFFF`) with borders (`#EDE7D9`), rounded-3xl cards, and soft ambient elevation
- Components: Rounded-full pill badges (`#F6EFE2`, text `#8C6221`), accessible high-contrast interactive elements

## Execution Lifecycle & Strict Workflow Rules
1. **Phase Discipline**: Strictly complete and verify one phase before moving to the next.
2. **Deterministic Schemas**: All database mutations must use strict TypeScript interfaces matching the Supabase PostGIS schemas.
3. **Theological & Safety Rails**: AI responses must be Scripture-grounded, disallow Jesus role-playing, and escalate crises immediately to human pastoral care.
4. **Mandatory Quality Gates (Run before every commit)**:
   - `npx tsc --noEmit` (0 type errors)
   - `npm run lint` (0 lint warnings)
   - `npm run build` (Clean production prerendering)
